+ * <p><b>Commands vs reports</b> (spec/EVENTS.md Media): the <em>commands</em>
+ * ({@link #playing()}, {@link #position()}, {@link #volume()}, {@link #muted()},
+ * {@link #loop()}, {@link #rate()}) are written by the app/user and emitted as
